            "speakerName": "奥希娜",
            "text": "流泉之众有别的商队在支援，我还是量力而行吧…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "502157",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "50215701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "50215701": {
            "id": "50215701",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "玛亚薇",
            "text": "对了，你还能联系到后续的药剂供应吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "50215702"
            ]
          },
          "50215702": {
            "id": "50215702",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "奥希娜",
            "text": "不一定，现在通信很困难，储备也不见得够，但我会尽力试试看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "502158",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "50215801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "50215801": {
            "id": "50215801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "乌图伦库",
            "text": "能被人记住，就算成为英雄了吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "502159",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "50215901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "50215901": {
            "id": "50215901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "乌图伦库",
